        "# 1. What Is Artificial Intelligence?\n",
        "\n",
        "## Study Sheet\n",
        "\n",
        "Artificial Intelligence, or **AI**, is a field of computing where systems are designed to perform tasks that normally require human intelligence.\n",
        "\n",
        "AI systems may:\n",
        "\n",
        "- recognise patterns\n",
        "- make decisions\n",
        "- understand language\n",
        "- recommend content\n",
        "- analyse images\n",
        "- predict outcomes\n",
        "- solve problems\n",
        "\n",
        "## Simple definition\n",
        "\n",
        "**Artificial Intelligence is when a computer system performs a task that appears to require human-like intelligence.**\n",
        "\n",
        "## Everyday examples\n",
        "\n",
        "| Example | What AI is doing |\n",
        "|---|---|\n",
        "| Netflix or YouTube recommendations | Suggesting content |\n",
        "| Google Maps | Predicting routes and delays |\n",
        "| Email spam filters | Classifying messages |\n",
        "| Chatbots | Responding to written language |\n",
        "| Face unlock | Recognising visual patterns |\n",
        "\n",
        "## Important idea\n",
        "\n",
        "Not every smart-looking system is machine learning.  \n",
        "Some systems follow fixed rules. Other systems learn from data."
      ],
      "id": "ZuH7wMf0CQKs"
    },
