        "# 6. Machine Learning Techniques\n",
        "\n",
        "## Study Sheet\n",
        "\n",
        "Machine learning has different techniques.\n",
        "\n",
        "## 1. Supervised Learning\n",
        "\n",
        "The model learns from data that includes the correct answer.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Features: attendance, completed tasks, confidence\n",
        "- Label: pass or fail\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2. Unsupervised Learning\n",
        "\n",
        "The model looks for patterns without being given the correct answer.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Grouping areas by digital skill score and AI training uptake\n",
        "\n",
        "This is called **clustering**.\n",
        "\n",
        "## 3. Regression\n",
        "\n",
        "Regression predicts a number.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "- predicting average house price\n",
        "- predicting salary\n",
        "- predicting sales\n",
        "\n",
        "## 4. Classification\n",
        "\n",
        "Classification predicts a category.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "- pass or resit\n",
        "- spam or not spam\n",
        "- high risk or low risk\n",
        "\n",
        "## 5. Clustering\n",
        "\n",
        "Clustering groups similar records.\n",
        "\n",
        "Example:\n",
        "\n",
        "- grouping learners by support need\n",
        "- grouping areas by AI readiness\n",
        "\n",
        "## 6. Computer Vision\n",
